    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ginger nut dough is stiffer than most biscuit doughs. Roll the balls small -- the size of a large marble -- and flatten slightly. They spread during baking. They will still feel slightly soft when they come out of the oven; they harden as they cool. Do not over-bake."
          }
        ]
      },
